  "details": "The new update for network ik has broken Final ik. Final ik is a tool that the majority of avatar creators animators and world creators use to replace fixed joints. Its broken in the sense that it will still work locally but for any other viewer, the ik will be broken and will not track properly. This is an issue that needs to be fixed right away, as it is very detrimental for the majority of avatar creators in vrchat. Here are some links that show examples of the issue.\nhttps://streamable.com/c6qic\nhttps://streamable.com/uc30n",
